We also use the `Typography`, `Button`, and `Snackbar` components from `@material-ui/core` to render the UI. When the user is logged in, we display a welcome message and a logout button. When an error occurs, we display a snackbar with the error message.

Make sure to replace `YOUR_CLIENT_ID` and `YOUR_REDIRECT_URI` with your actual Google OAuth client ID and redirect URI.

